Provides a wrapper to the ImageMagick/GraphicsMagick library; here with
ImageMagick 6 (the package libimagemagick6;
php84-imagick7 has ImageMagick 7, and the two conflict).

PECL imagick for php84 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/imagick of
the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20240924/imagick.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d.
